---
import BranchLayout from '../../layouts/BranchLayout.astro';
import BranchSteps from '../../components/BranchSteps.astro';
import PageIntro from '../../components/PageIntro.astro';
import Treatise from '../../components/Treatise.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');

const title = '偶景 · 相与为偶，形影不离';
const description = '偶景传承，系古人创造的一种养生理论。偶者仙偶，景者影也：偶景，又叫偶影，就是相与为偶，形影不离的意思。修行理论内容，未经科学证实，切勿迷信。';

// 顶栏入口：本脉直接给功法内容与报名须知，不走咒法那两项
const navItems = [
  { href: '/', label: '返回总目录', en: 'Index' },
  { href: `${base}/oujing`, label: '总览', en: 'Overview' },
  { href: `${base}/oujing/jieshao`, label: '功法内容', en: 'Method' },
  { href: `${base}/oujing/baoming`, label: '报名须知', en: 'Enrollment' },
];

const notice = {
  title: '敬告：',
  titleEn: 'A Word of Notice:',
  paras: [
    '各位在参加学习之前，请务必仔细阅读本文件，如不认可，请勿报名，免生不快。',
    '偶景传承，系古人创造的一种养生理论，长生之说虚妄，修炼之事无凭，未经科学证实，不符合主流唯物主义价值观。本人作为理论学者，仅保证所授内容系思想传承并非本人编造，不保证各位长生不老，仅供大家作为一项爱好，在饭后茶余研究古代养生使用。有意拜师学习者，请踏实工作生活、勿抱侥幸思想。当然如有兴趣，也可尝试实修实证，来验证古人理论有无可取之处。另本人所传授思想理论与宗教毫无关系，建议大家自信自求，不要封建迷信。',
  ],
  parasEn: [
    'Before joining the study, please read this document carefully. If you do not accept it, please do not enroll — to spare us both displeasure.',
    'The Oujing transmission is a theory of nourishing life created by the ancients. Claims of immortality are hollow, cultivation unproven — none of it scientifically verified, and it does not accord with mainstream materialist values. As a theorist, I guarantee only that what is taught is a lineage of thought, not my own invention; I do not guarantee anyone immortality. It is offered as a hobby — for studying the ancients\' arts of nourishing life over a cup of tea. Those who wish to seek a master and learn: live and work steadily, and hold no thoughts of luck. If curious, you may also attempt genuine practice, to test whether the ancients\' theories hold anything of worth. And my theoretical material has nothing whatever to do with religion; I advise everyone toward self-reliance and self-seeking, not feudal superstition.',
  ],
};

const chapters = [
  {
    num: '一：',
    numEn: 'I.',
    title: '偶景法课程简介',
    titleEn: 'Oujing: An Introduction to the Course',
    blocks: [
      { t: 'p', text: '修炼之事起源古秘，远古时期，有普遍修炼的一段时期，各类法门法门普传于世【修炼核心不曾外泄】，但是经过某些原因事件的发展，传承、法门逐渐被少数人收拢，保留了其中部分修法，并且传承了下去，随着岁月变迁和发展，逐渐成为隐传之法，不显于世，修炼的事情却随着岁月流传，越发的难见，逐渐成为一种传说，但自古以来，求道者却络绎不绝.....', en: 'Cultivation has ancient, secret origins. In the far past there was an age of widespread practice — the various methods passed through the world openly [the core of the practice never leaking out]. But through the development of certain causes and events, transmissions and methods were gradually gathered up by the few, who kept parts of the practices and passed them down. With the turning of the years they became concealed transmissions, no longer shown to the world; and as time flowed on, the matter of cultivation grew ever rarer to encounter — gradually it became a legend. Yet seekers of the Way have never ceased, from antiquity to now.....' },
      { t: 'p', text: '其中外界所知的名人数不胜数，比如：黄帝、老子，庄子等....', en: 'The famous names the outside world knows are too many to count — the Yellow Emperor, Laozi, Zhuangzi, and so on....' },
      { t: 'p', text: '偶景，便是曾经古时代，出名修炼内容之一。古老而神秘，且为特别存在群体才可接触，列如：达官显贵。', en: 'Oujing was one of the famous practices of that ancient age — old and mysterious, accessible only to a special class of people: the grandees and nobles, for instance.' },
      { t: 'p', text: '而随着岁月变迁，经过世面轮转之后，偶景逐渐在市面失传，一说这个便出现了各种理解，例如房中。【很多人一说双修就以为是房事，其实不是】', en: 'As the years turned and the world\'s face changed, oujing gradually was lost from the open world — and at the very mention of it, all kinds of interpretations arose: the bedchamber, for example. [Many, hearing "dual cultivation", take it for bedroom matters — it is not.]' },
      { t: 'h4', text: '历史记载：', en: 'Historical Records:' },
      { t: 'p', text: '偶景术在历史上有多种记载，例如在《真诰》中，偶景被用来描述男女双修的秘术，但这种解释是后世对偶景术的误解。实际上，偶景术的核心是仙神与凡人的共同修炼，而非简单的男女双修。', en: 'The Oujing method is recorded in history in several ways. In the Zhen Gao, for instance, "oujing" is used to describe a secret art of male-female dual cultivation — but that reading is a later misunderstanding. In truth, the core of oujing is the joint cultivation of immortal and mortal, not mere male-female pairing.' },
      { t: 'h4', text: '偶景术修炼的先例：', en: 'Precedents of Oujing Practice:' },
      { t: 'items', items: ['有神女鄂绿华与羊权', '九华安妃与杨羲', '右英夫人与许谧'], itemsEn: ['The goddess E Lühua and Yang Quan', 'Consort An of the Nine Blossoms and Yang Xi', 'Lady Youying and Xu Mi'] },
      { t: 'p', text: '以上结成道侣，相与为偶，形影不离，共同修炼，成仙得道。', en: 'Each pair became dao-companions — paired as one, form and shadow never parted — cultivating together, attaining the Way and immortality.' },
      { t: 'p', text: '若有真心想报名修行者，请与与本人联系。经考察后逐步传授。', en: 'Those who sincerely wish to enroll and practice may contact me. What is taught is given step by step, after review.' },
      { t: 'p', text: '欧景有两套体系，自力体系和它力体系，在这里就不多讲什么宏观概括一下', en: 'Oujing has two systems — the self-power system and the other-power system. No details here; only a broad overview, in brief.' },
    ],
  },
];
---

<BranchLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  glyph="景"
  label="偶景"
  accent="#8291b7"
  bgDim={0.08}
  bg={`${base}/bg/oujing-shenying.webp`}
  navItems={navItems}
>
  <PageIntro
    mark="景"
    title="偶景"
    titleEn="Oujing"
    sub="偶者仙偶，景者影也。偶景，又叫偶影，就是相与为偶，形影不离的意思。"
    subEn="Ou is the immortal consort; jing is the shadow. Oujing, also called ouying — to be paired as one, form and shadow never parted."
    meta="修行理论内容，未经科学证实，切勿迷信"
    metaEn="Cultivation-theory material, not scientifically verified — take nothing on faith"
  />

  <Treatise notice={notice} chapters={chapters} center />

  {/* 第一页只给两个去处：介绍 · 报名 */}
  <BranchSteps />
</BranchLayout>

<style>
  /* 文本框居中：题头、正文（Treatise center）、按钮同为一列 48em，列内文字仍左对齐 */
  :global(.page-intro .wrap > div) {
    max-width: 48em;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

</style>
